  "description": "Development-only compile-time rules for Solhigson projects: the IDE style rules with a fixer at warning in a packaged .globalconfig, superseded APIs in a BannedSymbols.txt under Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.BannedApiAnalyzers, and the SOLT test-class analyzers.",
