  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/solhigson-public/solhigson.framework",
  "published": "2026-11-04T18:27:52.087Z",
  "releaseNotes": "10.0.0: first release, carrying the Solhigson dotnet design at 517cca3 (docs/design/dotnet-design.md, Enforcement layer 2 and K). The .globalconfig sets the IDE idiom rules with a fixer, RS0030 and SOLT000-SOLT002 to warning, and EnforceCodeStyleInBuild is pinned in the package .targets; BannedSymbols.txt bans the ambient clock, the parameterless Random constructor, Thread.Sleep and the non-generic collections; SOLT001 refuses an xunit v2 test class whose only teardown is IAsyncDisposable, SOLT002 a File.ReadAll* of a constant .cs path, and SOLT000 an invalid, expired or stale solhigson-exceptions.txt line.",
